Achieving high selectivity towards electro-conversion of \( \mathrm{CO}_{2} \) using In-doped Bi derived from metal-organic frameworks
Yayu Guan a,1, Xurui Zhang a,1, Yanxing Zhang b, Tolga N.V. Karsili c, Mengyang Fan d,∗, Yuyu Liu a,∗, Barbara Marchetti c, Xiao-Dong Zhou c
a Institute of Sustainable Energy, Shanghai University, Shanghai 200444, China  b School of Physics, Henan Normal University, Xinxiang, Henan 453007, China  c Institute for Materials Research and Innovation, University of Louisiana at Lafayette, Lafayette, LA 70504, USA  d Department of Mechanical and Industrial Engineering, University of Toronto, 5 King's College Road, Toronto, Ontario M5S 3G8, Canada
